# My Favorite Movie: White Chicks (2004)

![White Chicks Poster](poster.jpg)

## Description
*White Chicks* is a **comedy** about two FBI agents, Kevin and Marcus
Copeland, who go undercover as Brittany and Tiffany Wilson, two wealthy
socialites, to stop a kidnapping plot in the Hamptons.

